==Battleground==
*15 [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~25.33 seconds<sup>700f~760f</sup>.
*15 [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~25.33 seconds<sup>700f~760f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Futenyan (Enemy)|Futenyan]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

